  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Strengthening for Promoting Accelerated Transformation (ISPAT)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aligned with the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development, the UNSDCF, and UNDP&#x2019;s Country Programme Document (CPD), the ISPAT project aims to strengthen public institutions by fostering accountability and evidence-based policy reforms so that an empowered NGOAB can manage NGO services more effectively, equitably, and inclusively, ensuring that civil society contributions to Bangladesh&#x2019;s development agenda are recognized, integrated, and scaled.</narrative>
  </description>
